{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99229","id":2658749768,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6eeU1I","number":99229,"title":"'Next Clip' does not play in `AudioStreamInteractive` resource when set to the immediately previous clip","user":{"login":"rothiotome","id":137085727,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCvDHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137085727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome","html_url":"https://github.com/rothiotome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-11-14T13:05:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T16:12:56Z","closed_at":"2024-11-14T15:15:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.stable\r\n\r\nFeature non available on previous stable versions\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6603) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900KF (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using an `AudioStreamInteractive` resource, you can reference the immediately preceding clip as the `Next clip`, but that clip does not play. This behavior doesn’t appear to be intentional, nor is it documented.\r\n\r\nA workaround is to change the resource type to `AudioStreamPlaybackInteractive` and manually set the `Switch To Clip` index or name. However, this approach becomes challenging to maintain when working with more complex interactive tracks.\r\n\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new `AudioStreamPlayer`\r\n- Create a new `AudioStreamInteractive` and assign it to the `AudioStreamPlayer` stream\r\n- Import 3 clips to the project. We are using ogg\r\n- Put the 3 imported clips on the `AudioStreamInteractive` inspector tab\r\n- Set the `Next Clip` of each clip so it creates a \"loop\" between the last two clips\r\n![AudioStreamInteractiveSetup](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d677a4a4-e1cd-4bcf-af02-c0529944aeed)\r\n* It's also happening when only two clips are referencing each other as the next clip\r\n- Play the AudioStreamPlayer\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[GodotAudioStreamInteractive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17748697/GodotAudioStreamInteractive.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"rothiotome","id":137085727,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCvDHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137085727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome","html_url":"https://github.com/rothiotome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rothiotome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99229/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}